  "root_cause": [
    "The first signal-59 trigger calls hide_process_tree, which calls hide_parent_lineage.",
    "The sample's sched_process_fork handler automatically marks children of a hidden parent as hidden.",
    "The harness creates the next worker cohort only after the preceding active trigger, so later no-marker cohorts inherit hidden status before their own trigger.",
    "Therefore the 114 alarms in loaded_no_marker are real K-to-S differences, not detector false positives, but they are invalid as normal controls."
  ],
